# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local — .gitignore covers it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase — required. Nothing runs without these.
# Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The AI layer — optional.
#
# Without a key, Sovereign runs on its offline reviewer: the whole loop works
# end to end, and every review it writes says plainly that no model read it.
# With a key, proposal reviews, decision rationales, reflection prompts and
# synthesis prompts are produced by a real model.
#
# The key is read on the server only and never reaches the browser.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model IDs get retired. If reviews start failing with a model-not-found
# error, set this to a current one rather than editing code.
#   claude-sonnet-5  balanced, and the default here
#   claude-opus-5    deeper reviews, more expensive
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where this install lives. Used for magic-link redirects.
# Vercel sets VERCEL_URL automatically, so this is only needed for a custom
# domain or a non-standard local port.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Proof of personhood. Optional, and absent almost everywhere.
#
# With no verifier configured, nobody on the instance can prove they are one
# person, so resonance at national scale and above is closed to everyone
# equally. Reading, writing proposals, asking questions and raising concerns
# are unaffected at every scale, and so is everything local and regional.
#
# The action scopes the nullifier: change it and every proof already recorded
# stops matching, because the same human hashes differently under a different
# action. Set it once.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WORLD_ID_APP_ID=app_...
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WORLD_ID_ACTION=sovereign-personhood
